          "id": "5cf37c3b-b128-4abd-9f49-1018e2deb4d2-check-001-fix-the-panel-title-error-rewrite-onto-card-or-add-a-real-title-to-panel",
          "title": "Fix the Panel title error — rewrite onto Card, or add a real title to Panel",
